  "project_description": "This module provides the following Schema.org types:\n\n \n schema.org/DigitalDocument \n schema.org/NoteDigitalDocument \n schema.org/PresentationDigitalDocument \n schema.org/SpreadsheetDigitalDocument \n schema.org/TextDigitalDocument \n \n Requirements \n \n Schema.org Metatag module 2.x or higher. \n \n Usage \n \n Enable the schema_digital_document module. \n Go to Administration > Configuration > Search and metadata > Metatag ( /admin/config/search/metatag ) and click the button \"Add default meta tags\". \n Select your entity type and bundle, expand the \" Schema.org: DigitalDocument\" fieldset and fill in the field mappings you want to publish.\n Back to top",
